Actually, I prefer another way to deal with Orcus.

"They say that if you live by the wand, you die by the wand."

I prefer to wait until there's a wall behind me.  Then, attack Orcus.  He'll
zap the wand of death.  It will probably miss (given that you're strong enough
to get to Gehennom), and the death ray will bounce back to destroy him.  Then,
you get a wand of death with which you can dispatch the Wizard of Yendor.

